<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent reconciliation. GMR wording and source Wylie remain verbatim; nothing is promoted to hgm_gloss. The verse orders nonvirtue, form-realm virtue and desire-realm virtue against black, white and both. The first dang joins form/desire and the final retained dang joins white/both; the intermediate list connector is expressed by punctuation. In and Respectively preserve physical verse-line capitals. The ending-agent expression is decomposed into de/it, zad/end and byed pa/brings: the local causative and its object/result are separately identifiable. English nominal and result framing what and to an remains unwrapped. ni marks the topic with no separately alignable English word; represent is the supplied first-stanza predicate, while final yin owns is. The positive virtue member of Non-virtue and both strictly tighter members of unstained are retained; no unresolved Non-affix mapping is introduced.</div>
